      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obobani bw’okogwa kwa Babiloni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro amang’ana igoro y’erooro ere ang’e nenyancha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koreng’ana buna ekembugu‐mbugu gekobongia ase ense ya Irianyi naboigo na obobe bokorwa ase erooro, ense eyio ekoondokia mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche norokigwe okorora kore ogokong’u mono; abaurereria nigo bagendererete kourereria, na abasaria bagendererete gosaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inwe Abaelamu, genda morwane! Inwe Abamedia, genda moboere! Ninsirie obororo bwonsi bwarentirwe n’Abaababeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio chibachwa chiane chianyegerigwe, obororo bwansoire, obororo buna obw’omokuungu okobina aibore; naichanire mono, tindi koigwa; nabeire nobwoba obonene, tindi korora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enkoro yane nigo egotiesana, omoondoko ombwatire; engaki ya mogoroba eyio naganyete yang’onchokeire na kondetera obwoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto nigo bakwarigania endagera bayebeeka ase emesa, babeeka abarendi bakorenda, naende baria na konywa. Bono inwe abagaambi, imoka, moake chinguba chiaino ebitinya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana aya nar’Omonene antebetie, “Genda mobeke omorendi atengere, nere oyio nabaraarerie abateebie amang’ana ararore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oyio kararore abariini chibarasi bagocha babere babere, na abariini chitigere, na abe chingamia, tiga ategerere mono, ee, ategerere buya kegima.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oyio ontengerete akarangeria neriogi buna eri’endo, “Aye Omonene, nigo ngotenena igoro ase egetengero omobaso boira; nigo inde ase emeremo yane ase obotuko bwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bono abariini chibarasi ngocha bare babere babere.” Na omotengeri oria agaaka eriogi riaye naende, agateeba: “Babiloni ogure! Ogure kegima! Emegwekano yaye yonsi y’ogosasimwa yasenyentirwe na gotiringerwa inse.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abanto baane, aba mwaoorirwe ase ekeooreri buna obori na koirurwa, amang’ana naigure korwa ase Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, naro nkobaraareria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obobani igoro ya Edomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro amang’ana igoro ya Edomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto nkondangeria are korwa Edomu, okoboria, “Omorendi, mang’ana ki igoro y’obotuko? Omorendi, mang’ana ki igoro y’obotuko?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorendi nigo akoiraneria: “Emambia yachire, nonya naboigo obotuko nao bore. Onye moganetie koboria erinde momanye, boria; moirane moche naende.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obobani igoro y’Arabia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro amang’ana igoro y’Abaarabu. Inwe abagendi b’ense ya Dedani, mobe mokorara ase amanani ’ense y’Arabia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abanto momenyete ase ense ya Tema, abwo bare nerang’o, bae amaache, na abwo bagotama, bae endagera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abwo nigo batamire korwa ase ogoitwa nemioro, na korwa ase emeyio yasomoirwe, na korwa ase amata atingirwe, na korwa ase emechando y’esegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Omonene ontebirie iga: “Ekero omwaka oyomo otaraera omwaka onga buna oyo bw’omorikwa, obonene bwonsi bwa Kedari mbosirigwe boere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto chituoni b’Abakedari, abamanyete koruta chinsara, nigo baratigare abake mono. Inche Omonene, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, nateebire amang’ana ayio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
